pany produces PP Woven Bags, bags made from woven polypropylene fabric for the storage, handling, and transportation of bulk goods, and PP Woven Lamination Rolls, semi-finished packaging material produced by coating woven polypropylene fabric with a molten polymer layer. It serves Food Processing, Fertilizer, Chemical, Cement and Construction Materials, Textile and Apparel, and Seed industries. Antala Industries Limited was formerly known as Octagon Industries and changed its name to Antala Industries Limited in August 2024. Antala Industries Limited was founded in 2021 and is based in Rajkot, India.","employees":11,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795775420},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795775420,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Antala Industries\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Antala Industries Limited Share Price","s":"Upstox","d":1795635233,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBZdTRtUm50MVh2a2tUbFRWanpNN3JEUjhxT1YwUWVkRUMwRlhQbkxvU3hxcEw3c1ZDNk1DaXN4dWQyZURXQTdvSGNpdDFpR0thV1J6bUhMWVNocDBFQUU1UXFHamszMEpiWk13YWxtTVc0QQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Antala Industries Limited (ANTALA.BO) stock price, news, quote and history","s":"Yahoo Finance Australia","d":1795540562,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFAwaHc2VmxaTkhwam9ldDBjLXdtM3VrQmxNTGlGV2dITUxLNjRZcnQ5Wk5teHczVDFXTmV4cVVhaU5SMDZNSlVFYk9uTVRuRHltdGcyTzdxOTc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Antala Industries IPO Day 2: Subscribed 0.87x; bHNI demand jumps 75%; QIB holds firm","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795489840,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"Antala Industries Limited (545024) Company Information","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1794909588,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPenEwUGFjQWF5dnVlZ1NTRmNBWTdDYy1CWUtEUXczdlhtX0Rya3hXZ3hoSFZSQXBuQThyRU5SNk9OWWQ2WGpVUGhXcE5DNmlkWFdoeXNtN01FblVhQVhpUWZwWkotX2xRNGhobDN6aUlZRGk2N24ySVB2TzVXUXFsRklpOXVLZVEzSmNoVFBmQUk2aFE?oc=5",